{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/Survive.png?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/multiplayers.gif?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Damned 2</i></strong> is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror game where four survivors must explore cursed locations, solve puzzles, and escape alive \u2014 while a fifth player takes on the role of a deadly creature hunting them down. Each match is unpredictable and filled with tension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/Solve.png?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/puzzles2.gif?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To escape, survivors must search for items, unlock doors, and complete puzzles scattered across the map. Every match reshuffles key elements, requiring players to adapt quickly. Teamwork, awareness, and a steady hand are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/Mosnter.png?t=1752873315\" /></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/monstro2.gif?t=1752873315\" /></div>Take control of a terrifying creature with unique abilities. Each monster offers a different playstyle \u2014 some stalk in silence, others create chaos and confusion. Master their skills and turn every match into a psychological horror experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/expirience.png?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/walk.gif?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Immersive Audio Visual experience:</strong>  Damned 2 uses Unreal Engine 5 to bring graphics and audio immersion to a new level of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Immersive VOIP:</strong> Our built in VOIP system simulates echos, reverberation and the environment around you. But be aware, monsters can hear you when they are hunting!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Be the Monster!:</strong> Choose from a variety of different monsters to play and scare your friends, each monster has a set of abilities for you to hunt and eliminate the trespassers. The monster can also be controlled by an AI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Co-operate:</strong> Play together with your friends with up to 5 players where teamwork is key for fast puzzle solving and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Randomized Environments &amp; Puzzles:</strong> Each play through is never the same. Keys, items and puzzles are placed in different locations whenever you start a new match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Custom Difficulty:</strong> Choose your game settings before starting a new match, customize the way you want to play. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/discord.png?t=1752873315\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2221390?t=1752873315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752873315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752873315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752873315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/Survive.png?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2221390/extras/multiplayers.gif?t=1752873315\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Damned 2</